You can try using the function addint() for testing all pairwise interactions, one at a time, for a given multiple-QTL model.

   data(fake.f2)
   fake.f2 <- calc.genoprob(fake.f2, step=1)
   qtl <- makeqtl(fake.f2, chr=c(1,8,13), pos=c(27, 56, 28), what="prob")
   addint(fake.f2, qtl=qtl, method="hk")

Can you give more details about "...made the program crash"?

karl

